cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
title: "ACTIVE: observable-aware quantum circuit reduction with certified error bounds"
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-08-03"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  ACTIVE is a primitive of the QXC platform, developed by Qinara. It reduces a
  quantum circuit to only what affects the measured observables — exactly by
  default, or under a proven per-observable error bound.
authors:
